## Handbook XML (docs build)

Author under `src/afw/doc/**/*.xml`. Supported inline tags: **`literal`**, **`strong`**, **`italic`** (not DocBook **`emphasis`**). `--cdev` skips handbook; use `./afwdev build --fulldev` (or `--docs`) to verify docs. See `afw-afwdev-python`.

